Power BI Build Guide


The purpose of this document explains how the Python-generated outputs are used in the Power BI dashboard.

Data sources

The dashboard uses CSV outputs generated by the Python analysis.

* District demographic profiles
* Population projection scenarios
* Insured occupancy
* Expected claims
* District clustering results

Data integration

The CSV outputs are imported into Power BI Desktop using the Text/CSV data connector. The imported tables are used to create the dashboard visuals.

Dashboard structure

1. District demographic profiles
2. Population projection scenarios
3. Insured occupancy and expected claims
4. District clustering

File location

The Power BI dashboard is stored in the powerbi/ folder.

Updating the dashboard

Refer to the refresh procedures documented in this guide before refreshing the dashboard.
